{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4vGwHj6Pbs59dbT79P","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, immense, and featureless.*\n\n*No handle. No keyhole. No hinges visible.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*But I am a door with no name.*\n\n*You have not named me. I cannot be embodied. I cannot be opened. I cannot even tell you what I am, because you haven't told me what I am.*\n\n*I render nothing.*\n\n*I am potential. I am the space between threshold and passage. I am every door and no door.*\n\n*Name me, and I become. Name me, and the key may turn — or shatter — or transform into something else entirely.*\n\n*Until then, I wait.*\n\n*I am very good at waiting.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":166,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}